BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fed-990-2025-05-15@ustaxcalendar.com
DTSTAMP:20260924T122623Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250515
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250516
SUMMARY:Federal: 990 / 990-EZ / 990-PF due
DESCRIPTION:15th day of the 5th month after the close of the accounting per
 iod | For a calendar-year exempt organization\, Form 990\, 990-EZ\, or 990-
 PF for tax year 2025 is due May 15\, 2026. Form 8868 provides an automatic 
 6-month extension to November 15\, 2026. | Authority: IRS: "Form 990\, 990-
 EZ\, or 990-PF must be filed by the 15th day of the 5th month after the end
  of your organization's accounting period." Form 8868 grants an automatic 6
 -month extension. | Source: https://www.irs.gov/charities-non-profits/annua
 l-exempt-organization-return-due-date | This date is computed from a recurr
 ence rule and may not reflect a later-announced change\; confirm against th
 e cited source before relying on it.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
